[I] Small JACK command line utilities

[T] Three small JACK command line programs: jack_fpmon watches an audio
[T] signal for denormals, NaN and Inf samples, jack_check watches for
[T] discontinuities in the JACK timing info and jack_proxy copies its inputs
[T] to its outputs.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

